🧱 Project Structure:

1 Controller Node (Ansible Host)

1 Master Node (Control Plane)

2 Worker Nodes (Cluster Nodes)


💻 Technologies Used:

Vagrant + VirtualBox

Ubuntu Jammy (22.04)

Ansible

Kubernetes v1.29

Calico CNIFirst 


🚀 CI/CD Pipeline Workflow (Python → GitHub Actions → Kubernetes)

┌──────────────────┐
│   Developer Push  │
│   Code to Main    │
└────────┬─────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌────────────────────────┐
│ GitHub Actions Trigger │
└────────┬───────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│       🧪 Test Job            │
│ - Install dependencies       │
│ - Run pytest                 │
│ ✅ Validate app works        │
└────────┬────────────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│       🐳 Build Job           │
│ - Login to GHCR              │
│ - Build Docker image         │
│ - Push to GitHub Registry    │
│   ghcr.io/<repo>:<sha>       │
└────────┬────────────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│       ☸️ Deploy Job          │
│ - Runs on self-hosted runner │
│ - Apply K8s manifests        │
│ - Update deployment image    │
│ - Rollout status check       │
└────────┬────────────────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│     🌐 Kubernetes Cluster    │
│ - Deploy Flask app           │
│ - Service exposed on 5000    │
│ - Accessible via NodePort    │
└──────────────────────────────┘
